<title>USA: Computone gets $2.5 mln credit line.</title>
<headline>Computone gets $2.5 mln credit line.</headline>
<dateline>ROSWELL, Ga. 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Computone Corp said Friday that it received a $2.5 million line of credit from Heller Financial.</p>
<p>The line of credit provides working capital for Computone to continue its rapid growth in the high performance remote access industry, it said.</p>
</text>
